rshd (8), rlogind (8), sys/NET.md
.sp 2
.in -5
.bd
BUGS
.in +5
.br
There is no re-exec on SIGHUP, no wait/nowait or socket-type field,
and no per-service user: every program runs as root, the account inetd
was started as.
